{
  "name": "Upload an image to Ampost and post it to social media",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Upload an image and post it\nAny binary file in n8n (a download, an email attachment, a Google Drive file) can go into a post: **Upload to Ampost** uploads it and waits until Ampost has checked it, then **Create post** attaches it.\n\n### Setup\n1. Install the **n8n-nodes-ampost** community node (Settings → Community nodes).\n2. Create an Ampost credential with an API key from ampost.io → Settings → API keys.\n3. Replace **Download the image** with your file source, and pick the platforms in **Create post**.\n4. Click **Test workflow**.\n\nAccepted: JPEG, PNG, WebP, MP4, MOV and WebM.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "ebdb6572-1f6d-4e45-a5d6-22318c525b33",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "04d702ac-3649-4c6f-aa8c-8c8a555d11a1",
      "name": "Run it",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://picsum.photos/1080/1080.jpg",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "d4c62f53-9e18-4429-a277-ef89e53a6ae6",
      "name": "Download the image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "media",
        "operation": "upload",
        "binaryPropertyName": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "27601a98-75e3-4bc7-ab73-ed41428241af",
      "name": "Upload to Ampost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ampostApi": {
          "id": "ampostApiCredential",
          "name": "Ampost account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "platforms": [
          "bluesky",
          "threads"
        ],
        "text": "Posted from n8n with an uploaded image",
        "additionalFields": {
          "idempotencyKey": "=upload-{{ $json.id }}",
          "mediaJson": "={{ $json.files }}"
        },
        "platformOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "0bbcb8b5-e8ad-4ef7-a640-dd93ceee5480",
      "name": "Create post",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-ampost.ampost",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "ampostApi": {
          "id": "ampostApiCredential",
          "name": "Ampost account"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Run it": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Download the image",
